Cities and towns notice for zoning changes-
HB0056
amendments.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Filer, Singh and Wasserburger and
Senator(s) Barlow, Olsen and Rothfuss
AN ACT relating to cities and towns; requiring cities and towns to provide
notice to landowners within a certain distance of proposed zoning changes;
specifying applicability; and providing for an effective date.
